a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1" :answer-field/choices "68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056"] [:db/add "295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1" :answer-field/correct "f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef"] [:db/ensure "295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf" :question/id #uuid "04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf"] [:db/add "04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{4}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf" :question/answer-fields "295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1"] [:db/ensure "04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "04