-c39aa859627c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{|4 x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c" :question/answer-fields "16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106"] [:db/ensure "1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c"] [:db/add "94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2" :answer/id #uuid "94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2"] [:db/add "94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965" :answer/id #uuid "e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965"] [:db/add "e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{8}\\left(\\opera