 integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71" :question/answer-fields "1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414"] [:db/ensure "dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71"] [:db/add "43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71" :answer/id #uuid "43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71"] [:db/add "43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71" :answer/value "\\frac{6}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459" :answer/id #uuid "d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459"] [:db/add "d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3" :answer/id #uuid "f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3"] [:db/add "f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "281