frac{3}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{3}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025" :question/answer-fields "9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe"] [:db/ensure "8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025"] [:db/add "b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1" :answer/id #uuid "b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1"] [:db/add "b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1" :answer/value "-2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e" :answer/id #uuid "03cf19