\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/id #uuid "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be"] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/choices "17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b"] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/choices "55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68"] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/choices "425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff"] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/choices "e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14"] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/choices "31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33"] [:db/add "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/correct "17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b"] [:db/ensure "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1" :question/id #uuid "a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1"] [:db/add "a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $4>0$, $|u|=4|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/4$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $12\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1" :question/answer-fields "ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be"] [:db/ensure "a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1"] [:db/add "6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f" :answer/id #uuid "6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f"] [:db/add "6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f" :answer/value "-2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7" :answer/id #uuid "53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7"] [:db/add "53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7" :answer/value "2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(10 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2" :answer/id #uuid "87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2"] [:db/add "87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2" :answer/value "2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "87ca676b-0308-5