\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $10\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165" :question/answer-fields "30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811"] [:db/ensure "37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165"] [:db/add "3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0" :answer/id #uuid "3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0"] [:db/add "3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0" :answer/value "4\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d" :answer/id #uuid "85c78