2-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db"] [:db/add "5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26" :answer-field/choices "52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb"] [:db/add "5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26" :answer-field/correct "52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189"] [:db/ensure "5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b" :question/id #uuid "c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b"] [:db/add "c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $15\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b" :question/answer-fields "5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26"] [:db/ensure "c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b" :question/validate] [:db/add 1759218606